Below is one possible fix that avoids the tiny “hairline” gaps you’re seeing when the browser’s zoom is non-integer: 

1.  Round the CSS‐transform translation to integer pixels before returning the image‐mode container.  
2.  Turn off canvas image smoothing on each tile so you don’t get sub‐pixel antialiasing at the tile edges.

Both edits live in src/ol/renderer/canvas/VectorTileLayer.js:

